                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature passes over or under the bridge, entering the area marked T</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Each creature in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:32] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to the effects of warpline hazards for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(3d10+14)[piercing]] damage as bony protrusions pierce their flesh. Until the creature receives magical healing, the DC for skill checks to restore Hit Points to the creature increases by 2, and the creature reduces the number of Hit Points they recover per attempt by 5.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the effect lasts 1 week.</p>"
